  <data name="AboutText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Spotify Taskbar Flyout v{0}

Controls Spotify from the Windows system tray via a native-style flyout menu.

• Left-click tray icon: open/close flyout
• Middle-click tray icon: play / pause
• Right-click tray icon: quick menu &amp; playlists
• Connect Spotify: enables in-app volume control &amp; playlist switching

This project is not affiliated with Spotify AB.</value></data>
